  messagePanel: {fileID: 15642466}
  bodyText: {fileID: 346420447}
  message: "A shield is a piece of personal armour held in the hand, which may or
    may not be strapped to the wrist or forearm. Shields are used to intercept specific
    attacks, whether from close-ranged weaponry like spears or long ranged projectiles
    such as arrows. \n->Looks like this one is missing"
