  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 38162922b50adda4b8af709a00507878, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  messagePanel: {fileID: 15642466}
  bodyText: {fileID: 346420447}
  message: 'Tyrannosaurus is a genus of large theropod dinosaur. The type species
    Tyrannosaurus rex, often shortened to T. rex or colloquially T-Rex, is one of
    the best represented theropods. It lived throughout what is now western North
    America, on what was then an island continent known as Laramidia.

    ->It seems
    like he is missing a bone'
