  bodyText: {fileID: 346420447}
  message: A katana is a Japanese sword characterized by a curved, single-edged blade
    with a circular or squared guard and long grip to accommodate two hands. Developed
    later than the tachi, it was used by samurai in feudal Japan and worn with the
    edge facing upward.
